messages.en:
{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{07 00 00}When I was little,{01 00 00 05 00} my
parents would always read
to me before I went to bed.{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{07 00 00}Kui ma väike olin,{01 00 00 05 00} lugesid
mu vanemad mulle alati
enne magamaminekut.{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{07 00 00}Why do you always have to
start a fight whenever we
talk, {ff 00 00 06}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}?{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{07 00 00}Miks sa pead alati tüli
norima, kui me räägime,
{ff 00 00 06}{04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00}?{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 16 00}Oh, dude!{01 00 00 05 00} That's not right!
You poor thing!{01 00 00 05 00} No wonder
you're so messed up!{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 16 00}Oh, sõber!{01 00 00 05 00} See pole õige!
Sa vaeseke!{01 00 00 05 00} Pole ime, et sa
oled nii sassis!{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 03 00}Ha ha ha! Got you again!{01 00 00 0a 00}
Oh, MAN! {01 00 00 05 00}You shoulda seen
the look on your face!{07 14 00}{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 03 00}Hah hah! Sain su jälle!{01 00 00 0a 00}
Oh, MEES! {01 00 00 05 00}Sa oleksid pidanud
nägema oma nägu!{07 14 00}{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 00 00}I suppose I'd be impressed
{07 05 00}if I understood a word you
were saying, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{09 09 00}

{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 00 00}Battle? What battle?
I thought we were just
talking about cupcakes!{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 00 00}Lahingut? Mis lahingut?
Ma arvasin, et me rääkisime
lihtsalt koogikestest!{09 09 00}

messages.en:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 17 00}Yeah, this guy's pretty
good, isn't he?{01 00 00 0a 00} I can give
you his number if you want.{09 09 00}

messages.et:
{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 17 00}Jah, see tüüp on hea,
kas pole?{01 00 00 0a 00} Ma võin sulle ta
numbri anda, kui tahad.{09 09 00}
